Looking at this problem, I need to find the minimum of $S = \sum_{i=1}^n \frac{1}{\prod_{j \ne i} |x_j - x_i|}$ over distinct $x_1, \ldots, x_n \in [-1,1]$.

**Answer check:** No leaked answers in the problem statement. Proceeding.

